## Key Concepts
- Distributed whitening and demixing across multiple nodes
- Gossip-based consensus for matrix fusion
- Time-varying mixing matrix tracking with adaptive algorithms
- Partial observation handling and permutation alignment
- Real-time performance evaluation using SDR/SIR metrics and latency constraints

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code sketch for a single gossip round
function gossipRound(W_local, neighbors) {
  const W_agg = average([W_local, ...neighbors.map(n => n.W_local)]);
  return normalize(W_agg);
}
```
